DERIVED WORK — ARM optimized-routines
================================================================================

`src/fast_exp.rs` is a Rust transcription of ARM optimized-routines'
`math/exp.c` + `math/exp_data.c`. This is the implementation **glibc itself
ships** for `exp` (ARM contributed it upstream), which is why the port is both
fast and, modulo one compiler contraction, bit-compatible with the platform
libm on Linux.

  Project    : ARM optimized-routines
  Upstream   : https://github.com/ARM-software/optimized-routines
  Commit     : f2e4faf58c6c671154f472a76eaaa977bb36c870 (2026-09-09)
  Accessed   : 2026-09-14
